Adjust pH to 7.2 - 7.4.  <br>
Prepare the medium anaerobically, dispense its 5 ml each in anaerobic tubes under a N<sub>2</sub>-CO<sub>2</sub> atmosphere (80:20) and autoclave. Add the following solutions via injection from sterile anaerobic stock solutions per 5 ml:  <br>
